<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-shixian" book-id="b-epitaph-shixian-excerpts" chapter-id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts" source-id="s-epitaph-shixian-excerpts">
  <p id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="epitaph_as_modernly_transcribed">晉故尚書征虜將軍幽州刺史城陽簡侯樂陵厭次都鄉清明里<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0025" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_A">石尠</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0028" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_A">處約</persName>侍中太尉昌安元公第二子也
永嘉元年逆賊汲桑破鄴都之後遂肆其凶暴東北其年九月五日奄見攻圍<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0073" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_A">尠</persName>親率邑族臨危守節義舊不回眾寡不敵七日城陷薨年六十二
二年七月十九日祔葬于皇考墓側神道之右
庶子<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0121" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_AC">恭</persName>嗣
夫人廣平臨水<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0130" ref="o0t_j8e_77s">劉氏</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0133" ref="o0t_j8e_77s">阿容</persName>父字<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0137" ref="9g3_mn8_3hi">世穎</persName>晉故步兵校尉關內侯
夫人琅邪陽都<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0155" ref="6u4_o8q_5qb">諸葛氏</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0159" ref="6u4_o8q_5qb">男姊</persName>父字<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0163" ref="x7h_snt_aaq">長茂</persName>晉故廷尉卿平陽鄉侯
長子<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0177" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_AA">定</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0179" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_AA">庶公</persName>年廿八
小子<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0187" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_AB">邁</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0189" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_AB">庶昆</persName>年廿二
女字<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0197" ref="77n_qzq_xi3_AD">令脩</persName>適黃門侍郎江安侯穎川<persName id="c-epitaph-shixian-excerpts:p001:m0209" ref="4b2_j6e_4xs">陳世範</persName></p>
</text>
